-    CONTEXT:
-    V600 built 100 accepted dual-side semantic contrast groups. It then stopped because Exp6863
-    compared Gemma tokenizer hashes computed from different receipt shapes. Exp6864 correctly
-    gate-blocked. The V599 memory policy still has 100% abstention and 13 harmful writes. The live
-    ARC induction path is shared-context-truncation-bound, and its stored diagnostic clips the
-    values needed to size the pool. This task freezes those facts and the changed V601 methods.
-
-    Work at {project_root}. The execution date is {date}.
-
-    EXISTING CODE TO READ FIRST:
-    - {project_root}/CLAUDE.md and {project_root}/CODEX.md
-    - {project_root}/research-program.md, Continuous Self-Learning section
-    - {project_root}/research-roadmap.yaml and {project_root}/ops/conductor-log.md
-    - {project_root}/ops/exclusion_manifest.yaml and {project_root}/ops/known-issues.md
-    - {project_root}/docs/research-notes/induce-shared-pool-truncation-2026-09-02.md
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6850_three_family_scoring_admission_canary.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6856_sealed_risk_sensitive_learning_audit.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6859_first_party_tool_gap_receipt_wiring.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6861_v600_branch_retirement_evidence_contract.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6862_dual_side_semantic_contrast_bank.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6863_tokenizer_aware_semantic_contrast_preregistration.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6864_three_family_semantic_contrast_scoring_stream.json
-
-    TASK:
-    Build a read-only V601 evidence contract. Recompute the V600 task set and terminal states from
-    primary artifacts and the conductor gate record. Freeze the accepted contrast-bank hash, a
-    versioned canonical tokenizer-payload contract, the memory observability boundary, and the ARC
-    context-headroom contract. Do not rerun science and do not edit old artifacts.
-
-    CONCRETE STEPS:
-    0. PRECONDITIONS: require readable V600 artifacts, live active-roadmap and conductor records,
-       exclusion manifest, and ARC truncation note. On failure, write
-       complete_blocked_v601_evidence_method_change_contract with gate_check_summary.
-    1. Add REQ-REPORT-6865 and focused scenarios before implementation. Cover a missing artifact,
-       synthetic gate artifact, wrapped field, stale roadmap, mismatched hash schema, and retired
-       max-token-only induction remedy.
-    2. Recompute the active V600 task IDs, deliverables, verdict strings, verdict classes, gate
-       fields, and current adversarial status. Preserve stored-versus-live disagreements.
-    3. Prove Exp6863 compared non-identical tokenizer receipt schemas. Record the exact field-set
-       difference without declaring the Gemma tokenizers equal or changed.
-    4. Freeze canonical_tokenizer_payload_schema=v1. Include semantic vocabulary metadata,
-       special-token IDs and add-BOS behavior, chat-template identity, tokenization settings, and
-       frozen probe outputs. Exclude timestamps, paths, prose detail, and wrapper-only fields.
-    5. Freeze the 100 accepted Exp6862 group identities and source hash. V601 may filter cells but
-       may not regenerate the bank.
-    6. Freeze decision-time versus offline-only memory fields and the bounded reliability-state
-       update boundary. Freeze exact memory transition checks.
-    7. Freeze ARC prompt, slot, actual n_ctx, requested tokens, generated reasoning, final-channel,
-       truncation, VRAM, and headroom fields. Explicitly prohibit max-token-only repair.
-    8. Set v601_evidence_contract_ready_score=1 only when every contract and changed-mechanism
-       boundary is source-hashed and exclusion-safe.
-    9. Run focused tests, ruff, OpenSpec coverage, adversarial verification, artifact-convention
-       audit, verdict-row consistency lint, and root-clutter checks.
-    10. REQUIRED ARTIFACT FIELDS: field_principles with one principle per field;
-       preconditions_checked; inference_substrate (deterministic CPU read-only evidence reduction);
-       duration_s; source_artifact_hashes; roadmap_task_rows; conductor_gate_rows;
-       stored_vs_live_adversarial_rows; v600_branch_dispositions; tokenizer_receipt_schema_diff;
-       canonical_tokenizer_payload_schema; frozen_semantic_probe_contract;
-       frozen_contrast_bank_identity_manifest; memory_observability_contract;
-       memory_transition_quarantine_contract; arc_context_headroom_contract;
-       retired_scope_non_reopen_manifest; random_seed; reproducibility_checksum;
-       v601_evidence_contract_ready_score (exact field consumed by Exp6866, Exp6871, and Exp6874);
-       gate_check_summary with failed check, expected value, and observed value for any blocked
-       verdict; verifier_is_oracle (false); verdict_class (positive | circular_positive | null |
-       blocked | disqualified | partial); honest_verdict (terminal and prefixed complete_).
-
-    Run command: cd {project_root} && .venv/bin/python scripts/experiments/experiment_6865_v601_evidence_method_change_contract.py --date {date}
-    Do NOT push. Do NOT modify scripts/research_conductor.py.
